<<[Lua] Luaforge にプロジェクト申請してみた>>

oluacle (Lua for Oracle) を LuaForge に置いてもらうべく、
プロジェクトを申請してみた。

:Project fullname
:: oluacle (Lua for Oracle)
:Project Purpose And Summarization
:: Oluacle project's purpose are:((br))
(1) For Lua, create library to access Oracle database more easy. (oluacle.dll)((br))
(2) With Lua, provide the third scripting tool to Oracle not SQL*Plus and PL/SQL (oluacle.exe)
: Project Public Description
:: 'oluacle' is a library to access Oracle database.
Diffences from LuaSQL are:((br))
* Bind-variable supported.((br))
* Few Lines required to access database((br))
* Supports Oracle-database only.
:Project Unix Name
:: oluacle

